{"id":"9c25dbe03b5c0fb1aacd43a119d4a9304d38d922","url":"https://www.ithome.com/1/030/101.htm","title":"鸿蒙全新版本来袭！华为星芒 OSTA O1 Pro 官宣首搭 HarmonyOS 7 AI 先锋版系统","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"IT之家 (ITHome)","byline":"作者：归泷","excerpt":"在今天下午的鸿蒙智行享界 V8 及星芒品牌发布会上，华为官方宣布，星芒开山之作 —— OSTA O1 Pro 是首款为 AI 而生的鸿蒙手机。IT之家从发布会现场了解到，华为星芒 OSTA O1 Pro 还官宣首搭 HarmonyOS 7 AI 先锋版系统，支持全新 AI 交互、系统主动智能和长期陪伴成长。#华为星芒# #HarmonyOS7# #AI手机#","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"paragraph\">\r\n            <p>感谢IT之家网友 <a href=\"https://m.ithome.com/html/app/open.html?url=ithome%3A%2F%2Fuserpage%3Fid%3D1297186\" rel=\"nofollow\">肖战割割</a> 的线索投递！</p><p><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"ithome://contentlist?api=https%3A%2F%2Fnapi.ithome.com%2Fapi%2Ftopmenu%2Fgetfeeds%3Ftopmenuid%3D230&title=%E7%8E%B0%E5%9C%BA&mode=1\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/app-images/on-the-sence.png?v=20260929\" w=\"1200\" h=\"200\"></a></p>\r\n            <p data-vmark=\"9ab9\"><a href=\"https://www.ithome.com/\" target=\"_blank\">IT之家</a> 11 月 20 日现场消息，在今天下午的<a href=\"https://hmos.ithome.com/\" target=\"_blank\">鸿蒙</a>智行享界 V8 及星芒品牌发布会上，华为官方宣布，星芒开山之作 —— OSTA O1 Pro 是首款为 AI 而生的鸿蒙手机。</p><p data-vmark=\"59fb\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/11/3815efe8-ff7f-4129-8295-2109ee2b9387.jpg\" w=\"1280\" h=\"960\" data-mpos=\"0,2\" data-vmark=\"01ce\" title=\"鸿蒙全新版本来袭！华为星芒 OSTA O1 Pro 官宣首搭 HarmonyOS 7 AI 先锋版系统\" srcset=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/11/3815efe8-ff7f-4129-8295-2109ee2b9387.jpg 2x\" data-original=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/11/3815efe8-ff7f-4129-8295-2109ee2b9387.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"615\"></p><p data-vmark=\"cfe3\">IT之家从发布会现场了解到，<strong>华为星芒 OSTA O1 Pro 还官宣首搭 <a href=\"https://hmos.ithome.com/\" target=\"_blank\">HarmonyOS</a> 7 AI 先锋版系统</strong>，支持全新 AI 交互、系统主动智能和长期陪伴成长。</p><p data-vmark=\"a2f9\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/11/ab9a0aea-912c-40c9-90a8-410492e01360.jpg\" w=\"1280\" h=\"960\" data-